    requested years. Both dates have to be available on both sides: a missing
    date neither confirms nor denies a match, so it is not an exact match.

    :param dict candidate: Candidate OL author representation
    :param birth_date: Requested birth date
    :param death_date: Requested death date
    :rtype: bool
    """
    if not birth_date or not death_date:
